{"id": 3780, "title": "Encouragement", "level": "Intermediate", "hsk_tags": ["HSK3"], "slug": "encouragement", "audio_url": "/audio/mandarin/3780_encouragement.mp3", "simplified_paragraphs": ["一个小女孩被老师排除在合唱团之外，所以一个人在公园里伤心流泪。过了一会儿，她开始轻轻地唱歌。", "”唱得真好!”这时，一个声音响起来，”谢谢你，孩子，你让我度过了一个愉快的下午。”说话的是一个老人，他说完后就走了。第二天，那老人还坐在原来的位子上，满脸慈祥地听小女孩唱歌……", "很多年以后，小女孩成了有名的歌星，但她一直记着那位慈祥的老人。后来，她想去找那位老人表示感谢，才知道，老人已经不在了。"], "traditional_paragraphs": ["一個小女孩被老師排除在合唱團之外，所以一個人在公園裡傷心流淚。過了一會兒，她開始輕輕地唱歌。", "”唱得真好!”這時，一個聲音響起來，”謝謝你，孩子，你讓我度過了一個愉快的下午。”說話的是一個老人，他說完後就走了。第二天，那老人還坐在原來的位子上，滿臉慈祥地聽小女孩唱歌……", "很多年以後，小女孩成了有名的歌星，但她一直記著那位慈祥的老人。後來，她想去找那位老人表示感謝，才知道，老人已經不在了。"], "pinyin_paragraphs": ["yī gè xiǎo nǚ hái bèi lǎo shī pái chú zài hé chàng tuán zhī wài， suǒ yǐ yī gè rén zài gōng yuán lǐ shāng xīn liú lèi。 guò le yī huì r， tā kāi shǐ qīng qīng de chàng gē。", "” chàng de zhēn hǎo !” zhè shí， yī gè shēng yīn xiǎng qǐ lái，” xiè xie nǐ， hái zi， nǐ ràng wǒ dù guò le yī gè yú kuài de xià wǔ。” shuō huà de shì yī gè lǎo rén， tā shuō wán hòu jiù zǒu le。 dì èr tiān， nà lǎo rén hái zuò zài yuán lái de wèi zi shàng， mǎn liǎn cí xiáng de tīng xiǎo nǚ hái chàng gē ……", "hěn duō nián yǐ hòu， xiǎo nǚ hái chéng le yǒu míng de gē xīng， dàn tā yī zhí jì zhe nà wèi cí xiáng de lǎo rén。 hòu lái， tā xiǎng qù zhǎo nà wèi lǎo rén biǎo shì gǎn xiè， cái zhī dào， lǎo rén yǐ jīng bù zài le。"], "english_paragraphs": ["A little girl was left out of the choir by her teacher, so she sat alone in the park, crying sadly. After a while, she began to sing softly.", "“You sing beautifully!” a voice said. “Thank you, child. You’ve made my afternoon a lovely one.” The speaker was an old man, who walked away after saying this. The next day, he was sitting in the same spot, listening to the little girl sing with a kind smile on his face…", "Many years later, the little girl became a famous singer, but she never forgot the kind old man. When she went to find him and thank him, she learned that he had passed away."], "english_full": "A little girl was left out of the choir by her teacher, so she sat alone in the park, crying sadly. After a while, she began to sing softly.\n\n“You sing beautifully!” a voice said. “Thank you, child. You’ve made my afternoon a lovely one.” The speaker was an old man, who walked away after saying this. The next day, he was sitting in the same spot, listening to the little girl sing with a kind smile on his face…\n\nMany years later, the little girl became a famous singer, but she never forgot the kind old man. When she went to find him and thank him, she learned that he had passed away.", "vocabulary": [{"word": "", "pinyin": "yī", "translation": "", "hsk": ""}, {"word": "", "pinyin": "gè", "translation": "", "hsk": ""}, {"word": "", "pinyin": "xiǎo", "translation": "", "hsk": ""}, {"word": "", "pinyin": "nǚ hái", "translation": "", "hsk": ""}, {"word": "", "pinyin": "bèi", "translation": "", "hsk": ""}, {"word": "", "pinyin": "lǎo shī", "translation": "", "hsk": ""}, {"word": "", "pinyin": "pái chú", "translation": "", "hsk": ""}, {"word": "", "pinyin": "zài", "translation": "", "hsk": ""}, {"word": "", "pinyin": "hé chàng tuán", "translation": "", "hsk": ""}, {"word": "", "pinyin": "zhī wài", "translation": "", "hsk": ""}, {"word": "", "pinyin": "suǒ yǐ", "translation": "", "hsk": ""}, {"word": "", "pinyin": "rén", "translation": "", "hsk": ""}, {"word": "", "pinyin": "gōng yuán", "translation": "", "hsk": ""}, {"word": "", "pinyin": "lǐ", "translation": "", "hsk": ""}, {"word": "", "pinyin": "shāng xīn", "translation": "", "hsk": ""}, {"word": "", "pinyin": "liú lèi", "translation": "", "hsk": ""}, {"word": "", "pinyin": "guò", "translation": "", "hsk": ""}, {"word": "", "pinyin": "le", "translation": "", "hsk": ""}, {"word": "", "pinyin": "yī huì r", "translation": "", "hsk": ""}, {"word": "", "pinyin": "tā", "translation": "", "hsk": ""}, {"word": "", "pinyin": "kāi shǐ", "translation": "", "hsk": ""}, {"word": "", "pinyin": "qīng qīng", "translation": "", "hsk": ""}, {"word": ""